  "content": "<p>Reliquified <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</strong></a> 是一款扩展模组，它将 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Relics</strong></a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</strong></a> 两个模组相连接，为游戏引入了多种独特的遗物。每件遗物都利用了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</strong></a> 的不同机制，释放其全部潜力，提升游戏体验。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/82Gbunq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"615\" height=\"100\"></p><p>必需的依赖项：&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RELICS（遗物模组）</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">IRON'S SPELLS 'N SPELLBOOKS（铁之咒语与法术书）</a></li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lbEmSA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"100\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.X 版本：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-irons-spells-n-spellbooks/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ggCi2k8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p><p><strong>问：我在哪里可以找到这个模组的遗物？</strong><br>答：所有遗物都会在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</strong></a> 或其附加模组添加的任何结构中生成。</p><p><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用这个模组吗？</strong><br>答：可以，欢迎使用。</p><p><strong>问：我可以将这个模组重新发布到其他资源站吗？</strong><br>答：不可以，你不能这样做。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/reliquified-irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliquified-irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dReliquified%2bArs%2bNouveau%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想试试我们的其他模组吗？ - 访问 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SHATTERBYTE.COM</a></span> 获取更多信息！</strong></p>\n</div>",
